    "body": "## Summary\nBind prose and code highlighting to active light/dark theme, preserving sanitization and responsive rendering.\n\nCloses #370; tracked by #337. Merge into main only after the preceding scope is merged and this PR is retargeted.\n\n## Source and validation\n- Current head: 70a80f0b206d827d1f546f7de15c6ffe5586f3cb\n- Exact content tree: cbf003ed29c58e652873a86c8bbb24af4599ba0c\n- Current-head Node 22/24 verification and built-browser checks: https://github.com/bigduu/lotus-next/actions/runs/39038095400 (pending; must pass before merge).\n- Latest inherited Workbench follow-up prevents an externally cancelled drag animation from reclaiming command focus. The next pickup restores the original animation configuration.\n- Browser tests use two sortable tabs, require actual source movement, immediately type exact search text, and verify no later focus/selection overwrite. Focused browser acceptance passed for immediate input, appended text, cancellation/Settings focus restoration, and subsequent normal dragging.\n- Full integrated-tree local unit suite: 3,398 passed. Current-head CI remains required; previous-head checks are not substituted.\n\n## UI evidence\nScreenshots, video and traces are retained with the browser-check artifacts.\n\n## Non-goals\nNo package publication, budget increase, backend authority change, or automatic retry of non-idempotent operations.\n",
